{"id":"forma","lemma":"forma","pos":"noun","rank":723,"glosses":["form","shape","mould/mold"],"ipa":"/ˈfor.ma/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"forme"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-DivoLetto-forma.wav","examples":[{"text":"La montagna ha una bella forma.","en":"The mountain has a beautiful shape.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mountain"},{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"a","l":"uno"},{"g":"beauty, belle"},null]},{"text":"Ci sono diverse forme di governo.","en":"There are several forms of government.","words":[{"g":"us / there"},{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"different, diverse","l":"diverso"},null,{"g":"of"},{"g":"government"}]},{"text":"Sono ancora in forma.","en":"I'm still in shape.","words":[{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"still / again"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Sei ovviamente in gran forma.","en":"You're obviously in great shape.","words":[{"g":"are","l":"essere"},{"g":"obviously"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"È davvero in buona forma.","en":"He's really in good shape.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"really, in fact"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"righteous, moral","l":"buono"},null]}]}